msgctxt "100"
msgid "There it is, Aniki! Let's get inside!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "By the way... what'd this Kanda guy do anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"A few hours ago, someone shot up the Kazama Family office\r\n"
"and murdered Kashiwagi-san, the captain of the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"But before he breathed his last words, Kashiwagi-san had\r\n"
"something to tell me: there's a traitor in the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "More likely than not, Kanda is that traitor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "This is no time to talk, though. Come on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Right behind you, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2340"
msgid "Rikiya"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2344"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""